# Quartered: a cross divides the arena into quarters, each arm broken by a
# gap, with a pillar in each quarter.

NAME Quartered
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS Y K
START 12 12 SE

# The top arm of the cross, with a gap part-way.
MOVE 15 1
DRAW 15 5
MOVE 15 9
DRAW 15 12

# A pillar in the quarter.
MOVE 6 6
DRAW 8 6
